    AND that setting is unset here. No block and no setting is named in this
    file -- both come from the vendored source and the block's own words.

    The second arm is the same rule for the platform's other optional runtime:
    a block whose declared engine or library is not installed on this box (an
    OCR engine, a PDF parser, a web-search client, an IFC parser) is a
    declared state the operator must see -- not a domain refusal and not a
